{"id": "36473", "title": "官场：花枝乱颤", "author": "少鸿", "category": "文学名著", "count": 68, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/36/36473/36473s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/36/36473.htm", "intro": "这是一部描写官场腐败的现实主义小说。作家从“我”——一个保卫科长的角度，由于他特殊的工作条件和身份，得以窥视作为市委秘书长姜大德的种种丑行。文中设置了两个性格、人生观迥异的女科长袁真和吴晓露。作为表姐妹，她们的感情很好，但她们的处事观和行为准则却格格不入。袁真正直清高、精神上有追求，而吴晓露为了往上爬，不惜利用肉体作为晋升的天梯，进行性贿赂，从此一步步登上风光的位置。而袁真因为坚持独立的人格，不屑混迹于肮脏的讨好、巴结和交易中，尽管才华横溢，却十多年始终在科长的位子上“晾”着，受到了不应有的冷遇，最后心灰意冷，毅然决然离开献出十多年青春的机关，放弃了“铁饭碗”，只身到了南方某城市……", "base": "files/article/html/36/36473", "chapters": [{"title": "一", "file": "2753112.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "2753113.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "2753114.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "2753115.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "2753116.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "2753117.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "2753118.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "2753119.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "2753120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十", "file": "2753121.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一", "file": "2753122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二", "file": "2753123.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三", "file": "2753124.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四", "file": "2753125.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五", "file": "2753126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十六", "file": "2753127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十七", "file": "2753128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十八", "file": "2753129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十九", "file": "2753130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十", "file": "2753131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十一", "file": "2753132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十二", "file": "2753133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十三", "file": "2753134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十四", "file": "27